\* All TLC check configs for AntflyEnrichmentLease.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyEnrichmentLease.tla

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStalePublish = FALSE
    BuggyEmptyPendingAdvance = FALSE
    MaxSeq = 2

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    TargetsOrdered
    OwnerMatchesLease
    CollectedAndGeneratedUnderLease
    PublishedArtifactsSafe
    AppliedDoesNotSkipGeneratedWork
    RetryableFailureDoesNotAdvanceApplied
    IsolatedFailureRecorded
    WorkerFailureStatusStable
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    EnrichmentEventuallyDrains

==== BadEmptyPending
\* Expected-failure config for empty pending scans advancing through hidden work.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStalePublish = FALSE
    BuggyEmptyPendingAdvance = TRUE
    MaxSeq = 2

INVARIANTS
    AppliedDoesNotSkipGeneratedWork

==== BadStalePublish
\* Expected-failure config for stale generated-artifact publication after lease loss.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyStalePublish = TRUE
    BuggyEmptyPendingAdvance = FALSE
    MaxSeq = 2

INVARIANTS
    PublishedArtifactsSafe
